Use calendar for single date selection. Bind `value` and set `type="single"`. Switch
`captionLayout` between `label`, `dropdown`, `dropdown-months`, and `dropdown-years`.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import { getLocalTimeZone, today } from '@internationalized/date';
	import { Calendar } from '~/components/calendar';

	let value = $state(today(getLocalTimeZone()));
</script>

<Calendar type="single" bind:value class="rounded-md border shadow-sm" captionLayout="dropdown" />
```
